; PrimitiveExtraction.v cannot live in the same directory as a driver. dune wires a theory's
; load path into a coq.extraction in a *descendant* directory only, so a
; theory declared beside a prelude is invisible to it — and a theory whose
; include_subdirs walk reaches a prelude makes dune abort with an internal
; error. Hence: theory here, driver one level down.
;
; That also makes possible a second driver later, reusing this layer rather than restating it.

(include_subdirs no)

(coq.theory
 (name RocqBottomExtr)
 ; RocqBottom for Primitives.v, whose operations exist to be realized
 ; here (quot_non_zero -> Z.div).
 (theories RocqBottom Stdlib)
 (modules PrimitiveExtraction))
